---
source: apps/review-cli/tests/help_snapshot.rs
expression: "help(&[\"--help\"])"
---
ReviewGraph command line

Usage: review [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  completions  Generate shell completions on stdout
  contracts    Contract (Rust -> JSON Schema -> TypeScript) tooling
  semantic     Semantic (vector) collection registry and cut-over
  eval         Quality benchmark tooling (developer use)
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --repo <REPO>                  Repository path (default: discover upward for `.git`)
      --format <FORMAT>              Output format [default: human] [possible values: human, json]
      --store <STORE>                Graph store backend [default: auto] [possible values: auto, local, postgres]
      --database-url <DATABASE_URL>  Postgres connection string (only with `--store postgres`) [env: DATABASE_URL]
      --color <COLOR>                Colored output [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -v...                              Increase log verbosity (stderr)
  -q...                              Decrease log verbosity
  -h, --help                         Print help
  -V, --version                      Print version
